WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.768
No exploits, no stolen data, no control bypass.

00:00:06.768 --> 00:00:15.081
No borrowed targets. Own the system, or have written permission to inspect it.

00:00:15.081 --> 00:00:25.082
No invented testimonials. A quote needs a name, permission and work that was actually delivered.

00:00:25.082 --> 00:00:34.010
No paid pack. There is one optional five-pound donation, and nothing else to buy.

00:00:34.010 --> 00:00:43.959
No automatic upload. Rendering happens locally. Publishing is a separate decision.

00:00:43.959 --> 00:00:50.530
No hidden empty probes. The ledger keeps the gaps.

00:00:50.530 --> 00:00:59.012
No client claim. The first file is a self-teardown of a source tree we own.

00:00:59.012 --> 00:01:06.489
Keep the limit. Keep the door open. That is the room.
